NSOR SOCKETS A0-A7" (at 157.5 113 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid 76bd3bae-0310-464a-a06b-e091f1a8d395)) (rectangle (start 20 286) (end 172 368) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 5dc536f4-386e-4d39-ad04-ffcb486f62a2)) (text "PHOTOGATE, ULTRASONIC, REACTION PAD, PROGRAMMING" (at 21.5 289 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid 8a3f531a-c1d1-4ec9-a667-ba45003f9e08)) (text "Prayog hub: Arduino-Nano-class board. CH340C gives USB serial and auto-reset (DTR through 100 nF). Sockets are +5V / signal / GND JST-PH; photogate on D2 (interrupt), ultrasonic trigger D4 and echo D5, reaction pad button D8 and LED D7. Flash firmware/release/prayog.hex over USB with the Arduino bootloader or over ISP." (at 20 330 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 44aabd2b-1499-480c-af7f-7f0ce65e50e7)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))